  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Support to procurement system in Mauritania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at improving transparency and promoting participatory governance in the field of public procurement by building and strengthening the capacity of stakeholders concerned. Moreover, the project will contribute to the implementation of the new public procurement reform and will support ARMP in operationalizing the recommendations of the various studies and evaluations through technical assistance and training of public procurement stakeholders.



More specifically, the project will contribute to strengthening the procurement system through the following:

&#x2022; Developing a strategy for sustainable procurement. 

&#x2022; Establishing a new framework for the professionalization of the procurement function.

&#x2022; Building the capacity of the stakeholders intervening in the public procurement sector.</narrative>
  </description>
